  "source": "import sys\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n, c = int(data[0]), int(data[1])\n    a = list(map(int, data[2:2+n]))\n    a.sort()\n    left, right = 1, a[-1] - a[0]\n    ans = 0\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        count = 1\n        prev = a[0]\n        for x in a[1:]:\n            if x - prev >= mid:\n                count += 1\n                prev = x\n        if count >= c:\n            ans = mid\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    print(ans)\n\nmain()",
